: (1) It immediately scores 2 points for Melded Kong, (2) Gives me an extra draw from the replacement tile to improve my hand, (3) Maintains offensive pressure while keeping my hand structure flexible, (4) The exposed J1 pung already commits me to using these tiles, so promoting to kong has minimal downside.\n\nAnswer: BuGang J1"}
